cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Metabis, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Metabis"
abstract: >-
  Metabis is a Python library, and the analytical core of the Metabis web
  server, for the statistical analysis and interactive visualization of human
  metabolic flux scores inferred from transcriptomic data, alongside gene
  expression, on the Human1 genome-scale metabolic model.
